{"type":"message","id":"2d6f3907","parentId":"c40fda11","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:38:53.222Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I can access the API now. I see the next_cursor is `1855799349343181009`. These notes are mostly \"ref\" type (reference/ref type) and many have no title. These are likely the notes that need to be migrated to knowledge bases.\n\nAccording to the MEMORY.md migration rules:\n- Skip notes with title starting with \"每日备份报告\", \"每日复盘\", \"每日发芽报告\"\n- Skip empty title notes\n- Only migrate valuable content\n\nLooking at this batch:\n- Some have titles: \"2024年6-8月中国AI应用增长之星榜单\", \"芯片失效分析与投资建议\", \"反脆弱与多样性\", \"单一培育效率高，但脆弱性也高\", \"成年人的标准\", \"职场的缺陷是现实的缺陷\"\n\n\n- Many are empty/ref type that can be skipped\n\nI'll set up a background process to scan through multiple pages, filtering for content-rich notes while skipping the noise.","thinkingSignature":"3bee4a64a7fd230e44ff0b3b2b79b721b630acb258059872c58d50ddf8e11141"},{"type":"text","text":"连接成功！开始批量扫描。这批有很多无标题的 ref 笔记，跳过。让我继续扫描几批，识别有价值的内容：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bvozngk0grj4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\n# 从 cursor 1855994895983210705 开始，扫描5批\ncursor=\"1855994895983210705\"\nall_notes=\"\"\n\nfor i in {1..5}; do\n  echo \"=== 第 ${i} 批扫描 (cursor: $cursor) ===\"\n  result=$(curl -s \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id=${cursor}\" \\\n    -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n    -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json, re\ntext = sys.stdin.read()\nsafe = re.sub(r'\\\"(id|note_id|next_cursor|parent_id|follow_id|live_id)\\\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+),', r'\\\"\\1\\\":\\\"\\2\\\",', text)\ndata = json.loads(safe)\nnotes = data.get('data', {}).get('notes', [])\nhas_more = data.get('data', {}).get('has_more', False)\nnext_cursor = data.get('data', {}).get('next_cursor', '')\nprint(f'NEXT_CURSOR={next_cursor}')\nfor n in notes:\n    title = n.get('title', '') or ''\n    # 跳过无标题和固定前缀\n    skip_prefixes = ['每日备份报告', '每日复盘', '每日发芽报告']\n    if any(title.startswith(p) for p in skip_prefixes):\n        print(f'SKIP_ID: {n[\\\"id\\\"]} | {title[:30]}')\n        continue\n    # 有标题或plain_text类型的\n    if title or n.get('note_type') == 'plain_text':\n        print(f'KEEP: {n[\\\"id\\\"]} | {title[:40]} | {n.get(\\\"note_type\\\",\\\"?\\\")} | {n.get(\\\"created_at\\\",\\\"?\\\")}')\n    else:\n        print(f'SKIP: {n[\\\"id\\\"]} | {title[:20] or \\\"无标题\\\"} | {n.get(\\\"note_type\\\",\\\"?\\\")}')\n\")\n  echo \"$result\"\n  cursor=$(echo \"$result\" | grep \"NEXT_CURSOR=\" | head -1 | cut -d= -f2)\n  if [ -z \"$cursor\" ] || [ \"$cursor\" = \"None\" ]; then\n    echo \"没有更多数据，停止\"\n    break\n  fi\n  sleep 0.3\ndone"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10268,"output":844,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51628,"cost":{"input":0.0030804,"output":0.0010128,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.006524159999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775687917670,"responseId":"06260bedc17de470f1befee06fb57b21"}}
