{"type":"message","id":"b127f3cd","parentId":"05995046","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:53:33.296Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to continue scanning AND migrate the identified notes at the same time. I can do both in parallel - scan more batches while also migrating the notes I've already identified. Let me spawn a subagent to handle the migration while I continue scanning.\n\nActually, I should check the migration API first to understand how to add notes to knowledge bases. Let me read the knowledge reference from the Get笔记 skill.\n\nActually, let me think about this more carefully. The user said \"同时进行吧\" - do both at the same time. I can:\n1. Continue scanning more batches in background\n2. Start migrating the already-identified notes\n\nLet me first read the knowledge base migration API, then start both processes.\n\nActually the most efficient approach:\n- Continue scanning in a background exec process (large batch)\n- Meanwhile, use the Get笔记 recall/save APIs to migrate notes\n\nLet me read the knowledge reference first to understand the migration API.","thinkingSignature":"28630c433ecf0d8f303a5498bbb7d1adddeed346ba5d8e6a27e40b7a59d58f12"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fkh8rmtra8uz_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/getnote/references/knowledge.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":229,"cacheRead":54542,"cacheWrite":446,"totalTokens":55347,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0002748,"cacheRead":0.0032725199999999997,"cacheWrite":0.00016725,"total":0.0037535699999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775688806448,"responseId":"06260f67c51104cb363f175f01ec72c8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"589d4507","parentId":"b127f3cd","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:53:33.384Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_fkh8rmtra8uz_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 知识库管理\n\n## 概述\n\n知识库的 CRUD 操作，以及知识库内笔记管理、博主订阅内容、直播订阅内容的查询。\n\n---\n\n## 我的知识库列表\n\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/list?page=1\n```\n\n参数：\n- `page`: 页码，从 1 开始，默认 1（固定每页 20 条）\n\n返回：`topics[]`、`has_more`、`total`\n\n每个 topic 包含：\n- `topic_id`：知识库 ID（字符串，后续所有操作接口的 `topic_id` 参数均传此值）\n- `name`、`description`、`cover`\n- `created_at` / `updated_at`：时间字符串（YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS）\n- `stats`：统计数据\n  - `note_count`：笔记数\n  - `file_count`：文件数\n  - `blogger_count`：订阅博主数\n  - `live_count`：已完成直播数\n\n---\n\n## 订阅知识库列表\n\n获取当前用户订阅（但非自己创建）的知识库列表。\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kbs-sub\ngetnote kbs-sub --page 2\ngetnote kbs-sub -o json\n```\n\n返回字段与 `getnote kbs` 相同：`topic_id`、`name`、`description`、`created_at`。\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/subscribe/list?page=1\n```\n\n参数：\n- `page`: 页码，从 1 开始，默认 1（固定每页 20 条）\n\n返回字段与\"我的知识库列表\"相同：`topics[]`、`has_more`、`total`\n\n> 与 `/knowledge/list` 的区别：该接口只返回他人分享/公开的知识库，不包含自己创建的。\n\n**订阅知识库的限制**：\n- ⚠️ **无法添加笔记**：订阅的知识库只读，不能向其中添加笔记\n- ⚠️ **查看源内容受限**：若知识库管理员关闭了「查看源文件」，则无法获取笔记原文，只能对该知识库进行语义搜索（`/recall/knowledge`）\n\n---\n\n## 创建知识库\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/create\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"知识库名称\",\n  \"description\": \"描述\",\n  \"cover\": \"\"\n}\n```\n\n⚠️ 每天最多创建 50 个知识库（北京时间 00:00 重置）。\n\n---\n\n## 知识库笔记列表\n\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/notes?topic_id=abc123&page=1\n```\n\n参数：\n- `topic_id` (string, 必填) - 知识库 ID（来自 `/knowledge/list` 的 `topic_id` 字段）\n- `page`: 页码，从 1 开始，默认 1（固定每页 20 条）\n\n返回 `notes[]`，每项字段：\n- `note_id`：笔记 ID（**字符串**）\n- `title`、`content`、`note_type`、`tags`、`created_at`、`edit_time`\n\n用 `has_more` 判断是否有下一页。\n\n---\n\n## 知识库选择逻辑\n\n当用户说「存到对应的知识库」或「存到相关知识库」时：\n1. 先调用 `GET /knowledge/list` 获取所有知识库列表\n2. 根据笔记标题、内容、标签，与知识库名称和描述做模糊匹配\n3. 匹配置信度高时直接执行，并告知用户存入了哪个知识库\n4. 置信度低或有歧义时，列出候选知识库让用户选择\n5. 用户未提及知识库时，**不要擅自存入**任何知识库\n\n---\n\n## 添加笔记到知识库\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/note/batch-add\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"topic_id\": \"abc123\",\n  \"note_ids\": [123456789, 123456790]\n}\n```\n\n⚠️ 每批最多 20 条。已存在的笔记会跳过。\n\n---\n\n## 从知识库移除笔记\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/note/remove\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"topic_id\": \"abc123\",\n  \"note_ids\": [123456789]\n}\n```\n\n返回：\n```json\n{\"removed_count\": 1}\n```\n\n---\n\n## API 配额查询\n\n```bash\ngetnote quota\ngetnote quota -o json\n```\n\n返回 read / write / write_note 各维度的日配额和月配额（used / limit / remaining / reset_at）。\n\n---\n\n## 博主订阅\n\n### 博主列表\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb bloggers <topic_id>\ngetnote kb bloggers <topic_id> --page 2\ngetnote kb bloggers <topic_id> -o json\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/bloggers?topic_id={topic_id}&page=1\n```\n\n参数：\n- `topic_id` (string, 必填) - 知识库 ID（来自 `/knowledge/list` 的 `topic_id` 字段）\n- `page`: 页码，从 1 开始\n\n每页固定 20 条，用 `has_more` 判断。\n\n返回 `bloggers[]`，每项字段：\n\n| 字段 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| follow_id | 订阅关系 ID，**查博主内容时必用** |\n| account_name | 博主名称 |\n| account_icon | 博主头像 |\n| platform | 平台（如 DEDAO）|\n| account_url | 博主主页链接 |\n| follow_time | 订阅时间（YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS）|\n\n### 博主内容列表\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb blogger-contents <topic_id> <follow_id>\ngetnote kb blogger-contents <topic_id> <follow_id> --page 2\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/blogger/contents?topic_id={topic_id}&follow_id={follow_id}&page=1\n```\n\n参数：`topic_id`（知识库 ID）、`follow_id`（博主订阅 ID）、`page`（页码）\n\n返回 `contents[]`，关键字段：`post_id_alias`（详情必用）、`post_title`、`post_summary`。\n\n> 列表不含原文，需要原文请调详情接口。完整字段见 [api-details.md](api-details.md#博主内容字段说明)。\n\n### 博主内容详情（含原文）\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb blogger-content <topic_id> <post_id_alias>\ngetnote kb blogger-content <topic_id> <post_id_alias> -o json\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/blogger/content/detail?topic_id={topic_id}&post_id={post_id_alias}\n```\n\n参数：`topic_id`（知识库 ID）、`post_id`（内容 ID，来自列表的 `post_id_alias`）\n\n返回完整内容，包含 `post_media_text`（原文）。\n\n---\n\n## 直播订阅\n\n### 已完成直播列表\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb lives <topic_id>\ngetnote kb lives <topic_id> --page 2\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/lives?topic_id={topic_id}&page=1\n```\n\n参数：`topic_id`（知识库 ID）、`page`（页码）\n\n返回 `lives[]`，关键字段：\n- `live_id`：直播 ID（**字符串**，详情接口传此值）\n- `name`、`status`\n\n**只返回已结束且 AI 已处理完的直播。** 完整字段见 [api-details.md](api-details.md#直播字段说明)。\n\n### 直播详情（总结 + 原文）\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb live <topic_id> <live_id>\ngetnote kb live <topic_id> <live_id> -o json\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/live/detail?topic_id={topic_id}&live_id={live_id}\n```\n\n参数：\n- `topic_id`（知识库 ID）\n- `live_id`（**字符串**，来自列表的 `live_id` 字段）\n\n返回完整内容，包含 `post_summary`（AI 摘要）和 `post_media_text`（原文转写）。\n\n---\n\n## 展示模板\n\n知识库列表：\n> 📚 你有 {N} 个知识库：\n>\n> 1. **{name}** — {description}（{note_count} 篇笔记，{blogger_count} 个博主）\n> 2. ...\n\n添加成功：\n> ✅ 已将「{note_title}」加入知识库「{kb_name}」\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775688813360}}
{"type":"message","id":"e7fd59b3","parentId":"589d4507","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:54:00.332Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand how to add notes to knowledge bases. The API is:\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/note/batch-add\n```\n\nWith body:\n```json\n{\n  \"topic_id\": \"abc123\",\n  \"note_ids\": [123456789, 123456790]\n}\n```\n\nThe topic IDs are:\n- OpenClaw使用: G0P1Z51J\n- 家庭教育: EJX1r7bn\n- 芯片业务相关: 9YeBam0m\n\nLet me now:\n1. Continue scanning more batches in background\n2. Start migrating the identified notes in parallel\n\nI'll do both simultaneously. Let me first start the migration of the notes I've already identified, and continue scanning in parallel.\n\nNotes to migrate (from the 5 batches I scanned):\n\n\n- 1855985058360408625 | 2024年6-8月中国AI应用增长之星榜单 | link → 芯片业务\n- 1855978469880498257 | 那些写出青云之志的封神诗词 | img_text → ?\n- 1855924418791108817 | 芯片失效分析与投资建议 | link → 芯片业务\n- 1855913280867181409 | 2024年6-8月中国AI应用增长之星榜单 | link → 芯片业务\n- 1855892558723438801 | 反脆弱与多样性 | plain_text → 芯片业务\n- 1855891705098916089 | 单一培育效率高，但脆弱性也高 | ref → 芯片业务\n- 1855801904849195321 | 成年人的标准 | ref → ?\n- 1855801813580671121 | 职场的缺陷是现实的缺陷 | ref → ?\n- 1855798895150616825 | 职业发展与照顾父母 | ref → ?\n- 1855754857777434937 | 成都5+2区域高中入学指南 | link → 家庭教育\n- 1855712798236018865 | 企业家精神与创造性破坏 | plain_text → 芯片业务\n- 1855711889850390737 | 孩子的教育重要的目的之一是找到她在社会中的价值 | link → 家庭教育\n- 1855707499320076433 | 明信片设计的提示词 | plain_text → OpenClaw使用\n- 1855707488582935393 | 小猿智能练习本S1/小猿学练机功能展示 | img_text → ?\n\nI'm continuing to review the notes list, adding several more entries that need categorization decisions or assignments to specific business categories. Some are clearly OpenClaw-related, others need further review, and a few appear to be from external sources like Xiaoyuan.\n\nLooking at the next batch, I see more education-related entries including high school enrollment guidelines, exam score analysis, and academic planning resources for the Chengdu region. There's also a reference to a mathematical puzzle about determining bear color through problem-solving. Looking at the next batch of entries, I'm seeing a mix of investment analysis on the Fed's rate cuts, market opportunity assessments, and macroeconomic policy解读 from CICC. There are also cultural entries on autumn poetry and historical bull markets, plus a reference to the China Mathematics Olympiad. I should organize the migration strategy while continuing to scan for additional batches in parallel. I'm weighing whether to do both simultaneously. Scanning 5 more batches should take about 10 seconds, but migration could be slow depending on API rate limits. I think I'll start the background scan first, then handle the migration sequentially by knowledge base category since each batch-add supports up to 20 notes.\n\nNow I'm going to kick off the background scan and begin migrating the three knowledge bases while that's running in parallel.","thinkingSignature":"231f1e6dd846949c621c9103f5a8e0d59222a383e589831f758ccf3e005d15fd"},{"type":"text","text":"好！我同时进行：一边继续扫描，一边开始迁移已识别的笔记。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cgyvagn8wfkl_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\n# 继续扫描10批，记录所有有价值笔记\ncursor=\"1854963401604890969\"\ntotal_found=0\n\nfor i in {1..10}; do\n  result=$(curl -s \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id=${cursor}\" \\\n    -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n    -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json, re\ntext = sys.stdin.read()\nsafe = re.sub(r'\\\"(id|note_id|next_cursor|parent_id|follow_id|live_id)\\\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+),', r'\\\"\\1\\\":\\\"\\2\\\",', text)\ndata = json.loads(safe)\nnotes = data.get('data', {}).get('notes', [])\nhas_more = data.get('data', {}).get('has_more', False)\nnext_cursor = data.get('data', {}).get('next_cursor', '')\nprint(f'NEXT_CURSOR={next_cursor}')\nfor n in notes:\n    title = n.get('title', '') or ''\n    skip_prefixes = ['每日备份报告', '每日复盘', '每日发芽报告']\n    if any(title.startswith(p) for p in skip_prefixes):\n        continue\n    if title or n.get('note_type') == 'plain_text':\n        print(f'KEEP: {n[\\\"id\\\"]} | {title[:45]} | {n.get(\\\"note_type\\\",\\\"?\\\")} | {n.get(\\\"created_at\\\",\\\"?\\\")}')\n\")\n  next_cursor=$(echo \"$result\" | grep \"NEXT_CURSOR=\" | head -1 | cut -d= -f2)\n  count=$(echo \"$result\" | grep -c \"KEEP:\")\n  total_found=$((total_found + count))\n  echo \"=== 第${i}批: 新增${count}条有价值笔记, 累计${total_found}条, next_cursor=${next_cursor}\"\n  cursor=\"$next_cursor\"\n  if [ \"$next_cursor\" = \"None\" ] || [ -z \"$next_cursor\" ]; then\n    echo \"扫描结束\"\n    break\n  fi\n  sleep 0.3\ndone\necho \"DONE_SCANNING\"","background":true}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":16768,"output":1384,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58668,"cost":{"input":0.0050304,"output":0.0016607999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.009122159999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775688813385,"responseId":"06260f6dbd09ad90bf52987b1cb68234"}}
