{"type":"message","id":"64331dc3","parentId":"c7101b5d","timestamp":"2026-04-08T23:06:45.953Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! So the API returns `success_count: 0` and the note is in `failed_note_ids`. But there's no error message - just that it failed. This might mean the note was already in the knowledge base (duplicate), so it \"failed\" because it already exists.\n\nThe earlier migrations that I did manually (the ones on 2026-04-07 and today) already added most of these notes, so they're now \"already in the KB\" and fail to add again.\n\nSo the total migrated count being 0 makes sense - most of these notes were already migrated in previous sessions!\n\nLet me verify this theory - the note ID `1854798449090824897` was in our first batch add for chip, and it showed success_count 17 with failed IDs including this one. \n\nSince I manually migrated about 50 notes across the three knowledge bases this session and about 144 in the previous session, we've likely already captured most of the high-value content. The \"failures\" are probably just duplicates. I should update the migration script to count both successful additions and already-exists cases as wins.","thinkingSignature":"a7e27e10a8064ad9e225910b72663c9411be7f67c6e1063367b1f97ef3000dbc"},{"type":"text","text":"原来如此！`failed_note_ids` 里的笔记是**已经在库中**的（重复添加）。之前手动迁移那批已经入库了，所以 API 返回失败。\n\n这说明有价值的主要笔记**之前已经迁移完成**了！剩下的都是已经在库中的。\n\n让我验证一下：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_di6hfd0tfq8y_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\n# 验证知识库里的笔记数量\necho \"=== 芯片业务知识库 (9YeBam0m) ===\"\ncurl -s \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/notes?topic_id=9YeBam0m&page=1\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json,re; text=sys.stdin.read()\nsafe=re.sub(r'\\\"(id|note_id|next_cursor)\\\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+),', r'\\\"\\1\\\":\\\"\\2\\\",', text)\nd=json.loads(safe)\ndata=d.get('data',{})\nnotes=data.get('notes',[])\ntotal=data.get('total',0)\nhas_more=data.get('has_more',False)\nprint(f'笔记数: {total}, has_more: {has_more}')\nfor n in notes[:5]:\n    print(f'  - {n.get(\\\"title\\\",\\\"无标题\\\")[:40]} | {n.get(\\\"note_id\\\",\\\"\\\")}')\n\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 家庭教育知识库 (EJX1r7bn) ===\"\ncurl -s \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/notes?topic_id=EJX1r7bn&page=1\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json,re; text=sys.stdin.read()\nsafe=re.sub(r'\\\"(id|note_id|next_cursor)\\\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+),', r'\\\"\\1\\\":\\\"\\2\\\",', text)\nd=json.loads(safe)\ndata=d.get('data',{})\nnotes=data.get('notes',[])\ntotal=data.get('total',0)\nhas_more=data.get('has_more',False)\nprint(f'笔记数: {total}, has_more: {has_more}')\nfor n in notes[:5]:\n    print(f'  - {n.get(\\\"title\\\",\\\"无标题\\\")[:40]} | {n.get(\\\"note_id\\\",\\\"\\\")}')\n\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== OpenClaw知识库 (G0P1Z51J) ===\"\ncurl -s \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/notes?topic_id=G0P1Z51J&page=1\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json,re; text=sys.stdin.read()\nsafe=re.sub(r'\\\"(id|note_id|next_cursor)\\\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+),', r'\\\"\\1\\\":\\\"\\2\\\",', text)\nd=json.loads(safe)\ndata=d.get('data',{})\nnotes=data.get('notes',[])\ntotal=data.get('total',0)\nhas_more=data.get('has_more',False)\nprint(f'笔记数: {total}, has_more: {has_more}')\nfor n in notes[:5]:\n    print(f'  - {n.get(\\\"title\\\",\\\"无标题\\\")[:40]} | {n.get(\\\"note_id\\\",\\\"\\\")}')\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":35973,"output":1101,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens