{"type":"message","id":"017c30e4","parentId":"1e75067b","timestamp":"2026-04-09T00:14:39.831Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_gycnz4ki9qhf_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n    \"success\": false,\n    \"data\": null,\n    \"error\": {\n        \"code\": 10000,\n        \"message\": \"\\u53c2\\u6570\\u9519\\u8bef\"\n    },\n    \"meta\": {\n        \"timestamp\": 1775693679\n    },\n    \"request_id\": \"f30928c2b653002\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":367,"aggregated":"{\n    \"success\": false,\n    \"data\": null,\n    \"error\": {\n        \"code\": 10000,\n        \"message\": \"\\u53c2\\u6570\\u9519\\u8bef\"\n    },\n    \"meta\": {\n        \"timestamp\": 1775693679\n    },\n    \"request_id\": \"f30928c2b653002\"\n}","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775693679807}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc7dfad4","parentId":"017c30e4","timestamp":"2026-04-09T00:14:42.957Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Parameter error for the recall API. Let me check the proper API format. Let me look at the skill's search reference.","thinkingSignature":"7674f8a8b1070ba188cf81666e5779dea8c1b14dbc80e83e3c2df5e1b229eb9d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qus4qpsmb9vf_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/getnote/references/search.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":59170,"output":63,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99749,"cost":{"input":0.017751,"output":0.0000756,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.020257559999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775693679832,"responseId":"06262270f2c06e2e4c8427647935bc5c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"dcb81ff5","parentId":"cc7dfad4","timestamp":"2026-04-09T00:14:43.052Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_qus4qpsmb9vf_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 语义搜索\n\n## 概述\n\n在笔记中进行语义召回，支持全局搜索和指定知识库搜索。无需拉取全部数据，直接返回相关片段。\n\n---\n\n## 全局语义搜索\n\n> 适用场景：「搜一下」「找找我哪些笔记提到了 XX」\n\n**所需 scope**: `note.recall.read`\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/recall\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"query\": \"搜索关键词\",\n  \"top_k\": 3\n}\n```\n\n| 参数 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| query | string, 必填 | 搜索关键词或语义描述 |\n| top_k | int, 可选 | 返回数量，默认 **3**，最大 **10** |\n\n返回结构（结果已按相关度**从高到低**排序）：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"note_id\": \"1896830231705320746\",\n      \"note_type\": \"NOTE\",\n      \"title\": \"笔记标题\",\n      \"content\": \"笔记内容片段\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2025-12-24 15:20:15\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 知识库语义搜索\n\n> 适用场景：「在我的 XX 知识库搜一下 XX」\n\n**所需 scope**: `note.topic.recall.read`\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/recall/knowledge\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"topic_id\": \"qnNX75j0\",\n  \"query\": \"搜索关键词\",\n  \"top_k\": 3\n}\n```\n\n| 参数 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| topic_id | string, 必填 | 知识库 ID（来自 `/knowledge/list` 的 `topic_id` 字段） |\n| query | string, 必填 | 搜索关键词或语义描述 |\n| top_k | int, 可选 | 返回数量，默认 **3**，最大 **10** |\n\n返回结构同全局搜索。\n\n---\n\n## 召回结果字段说明\n\n| 字段 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| note_id | 笔记 ID（string）；**仅 `NOTE` 类型有值**，其余类型均为空 |\n| note_type | 内容类型：`NOTE` / `FILE` / `BLOGGER` / `LIVE` / `URL` / `DEDAO` |\n| title | 笔记/文档标题 |\n| content | 相关内容片段 |\n| created_at | 创建/发布时间（YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS）|\n| page_no | `FILE` 类型时表示文件页码，其余类型省略 |\n\n> **后续操作**：`NOTE` 类型可调详情接口获取全文，其余类型只能展示召回片段。\n\n---\n\n## 示例对话\n\n> 用户：「找找我哪些笔记提到了大模型 API」\n> → `POST /recall` `{ \"query\": \"大模型 API\", \"top_k\": 3 }`\n\n> 用户：「在我的 AI 学习知识库里搜一下 RAG」\n> → 先调 `/knowledge/list` 找到对应知识库的 `topic_id`，再 `POST /recall/knowledge` `{ \"topic_id\": \"xxx\", \"query\": \"RAG\", \"top_k\": 3 }`\n\n---\n\n## 展示模板\n\n搜索完成后：\n> 🔍 找到 {N} 条相关笔记：\n>\n> 1. **{title}** （{created_at}）\n>    {content 片段}\n>\n> 2. ...\n>\n> （`NOTE` 类型可回复「看原文」获取完整内容）\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775693683025}}
{"type":"message","id":"a7790ee2","parentId":"dcb81ff5","timestamp":"2026-04-09T00:14:53.250Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - for knowledge search, it takes `topic_id` (singular), not `topic_ids` (plural). Let me fix the API call.","thinkingSignature":"6984ea521a1ecc6ec5e55a74044c70ca359383156bd6ab25fa39896a0a0f84c9"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9n4zmtp3dgct_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\necho \"=== 芯片业务知识库内容样例 (9YeBam0m) ===\"\nfor kw in \"半导体 芯片\" \"中美 贸易\" \"出口管制 EAR\" \"华为\" \"AI 大模型\"; do\n  echo \"--- 搜索: $kw ---\"\n  curl -s -X POST \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/recall/knowledge\" \\\n    -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n    -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\\\"topic_id\\\":\\\"9YeBam0m\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"$kw\\\",\\\"top_k\\\":2}\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin)\nresults = d.get('data',{}).get('results',[])\nfor r in results:\n    print(f'  [{r.get(\\\"note_type\\\",\\\"?\\\")}] {r.get(\\\"title\\\",\\\"无标题\\\")[:40]}')\n    print(f'    {r.get(\\\"content\\\",\\\"\\\")[:80]}...')\n\" 2>/dev/null\ndone\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 家庭教育知识库内容样例 (EJX1r7bn) ===\"\nfor kw in \"中考 高考\" \"成都 学校\" \"高中 初中\" \"英语 学习\" \"孩子 教育\"; do\n  echo \"--- 搜索: $kw ---\"\n  curl -s -X POST \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/recall/knowledge\" \\\n    -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n    -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\\\"topic_id\\\":\\\"EJX1r7bn\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"$kw\\\",\\\"top_k\\\":2}\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin)\nresults = d.get('data',{}).get('results',[])\nfor r in results:\n    print(f'  [{r.get(\\\"note_type\\\",\\\"?\\\")}] {r.get(\\\"title\\\",\\\"无标题\\\")[:40]}')\n    print(f'    {r.get(\\\"content\\\",\\\"\\\")[:80]}...')\n\" 2>/dev/null\ndone"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":60006,"output":626,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101148,"cost":{"input":0.0180018,"output":0.0007511999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.021183959999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775693683053,"responseId":"06262273d63caa9b95d2efc0e3c9654a"}}
