{"type":"message","id":"bf6c7baa","parentId":"b347fd38","timestamp":"2026-04-09T01:02:56.325Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent an image and wants it saved to their Get笔记 (GetNote). I need to use the Get笔记 skill to save this image. Let me first look at the image to understand what it is, then use the appropriate API to save it.","thinkingSignature":"54e5f4a2018feffb650a1ce2987e96b019451b0bf84cddc51069bc67351c383e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qhx58rs7b3vd_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"描述这张图片的内容","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/92b1c927-56bb-4e71-a11f-a72c0b2445b2.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":126,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":105136,"totalTokens":105392,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0001512,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.039426,"total":0.039616200000000004}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775696563394,"responseId":"06262db435e2dd831928378138ef71ec"}}
{"type":"message","id":"fa66daf3","parentId":"bf6c7baa","timestamp":"2026-04-09T01:03:08.238Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_qhx58rs7b3vd_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片展示了一段关于中国传统文化中“五福”定义的文字。\n\n以下是图片的具体内容描述：\n\n*   **背景：** 图片采用深咖啡色的渐变背景，色调深沉、庄重。\n*   **主体文字：** 正中央是用白色宋体（或类似的衬线体）书写的中文：\n    > **“五福：一曰寿，二曰富，三曰康宁，四曰攸好德，五曰考终命。”**\n*   **文字含义：** 这段话出自《尚书》，定义了“五福”的五个方面：\n    1.  **寿：** 长寿。\n    2.  **富：** 富足。\n    3.  **康宁：** 健康平安。\n    4.  **攸好德：** 爱好美德。\n    5.  **考终命：** 善终，指能预先知道自己的死期，临终时没有痛苦。\n*   **出处标注：** 在主体文字的右下方，有破折号引导的出处说明：\n    > **——《尚书·洪范》**\n*   **排版风格：** 整体设计非常简洁大方，具有浓厚的文化气息，常用于书法作品、文化宣传或教育幻灯片中。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/92b1c927-56bb-4e71-a11f-a72c0b2445b2.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775696588202}}
{"type":"message","id":"975d2288","parentId":"fa66daf3","timestamp":"2026-04-09T01:03:13.815Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The image contains content about the \"Five Blessings\" (五福) from the Book of Documents (尚书·洪范). Now I need to save this to Get笔记. Let me use the `/note save` skill - image mode.\n\nLet me read the save reference to know the correct API format.","thinkingSignature":"50a0fccec15b48579121113f5b769c950cc06ae28afe2f5241f90701e19c6ecd"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_v7qz68cgntgz_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/getnote/references/save.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":65134,"output":101,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105751,"cost":{"input":0.0195402,"output":0.00012119999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02209236}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775696588239,"responseId":"06262dccd02a21e6f4ca4d906c95588e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ba4588f0","parentId":"975d2288","timestamp":"2026-04-09T01:03:13.902Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_v7qz68cgntgz_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 保存笔记\n\n## 概述\n\n新建文本、链接、图片三种类型的笔记。文本笔记同步完成；链接和图片笔记是异步任务，需轮询进度。\n\n---\n\n## 新建笔记\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/save\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n**仅支持新建，不支持编辑**。\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"笔记标题\",\n  \"content\": \"Markdown 内容\",\n  \"note_type\": \"plain_text\",\n  \"tags\": [\"标签1\", \"标签2\"],\n  \"parent_id\": 0,\n  \"link_url\": \"https://...\",\n  \"image_urls\": [\"https://...\"]\n}\n```\n\n详细字段说明见 [api-details.md](api-details.md#新建笔记字段说明)。\n\n- `plain_text`：同步返回，立即完成，响应中包含 `note_id`（字符串）\n- `link` / `img_text`：返回 `task_id`，**必须轮询** `/task/progress`\n\n---\n\n## 查询任务进度\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/task/progress\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\"task_id\": \"task_abc123xyz\"}\n```\n\n返回：\n- `status`: `pending` | `processing` | `success` | `failed`\n- `note_id`: 成功时返回笔记 ID（**字符串**）；任务进行中时值为 `\"0\"`，需过滤\n- `error_msg`: 失败时返回错误信息\n\n**建议 10-30 秒间隔轮询，直到 success 或 failed**。\n\n---\n\n## 链接笔记完整流程\n\n> ⚠️ **必须遵循的体验流程**\n\n**步骤 1**：提交任务\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/save {note_type:\"link\", link_url:\"https://...\"}\n```\n\n返回结构：\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"created_count\": 1,\n    \"tasks\": [{\"task_id\": \"69c3995e99f5a67e\", \"url\": \"https://...\"}],\n    \"message\": \"链接笔记任务已创建，请通过 /note/task/progress 接口查询处理状态\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n⚠️ **task_id 在 `data.tasks[0].task_id`**，不是 `data.task_id`。\n\n拿到 task_id 后，**立即发消息给用户**：\n> ✅ 链接已保存，正在抓取原文和生成总结，稍后告诉你结果...\n\n> ⚠️ **重复链接说明**：OpenAPI 层不做 URL 去重，重复保存同一链接会创建新笔记任务。App 端有去重提示，API 调用方需自行判断。\n\n**步骤 2**：后台轮询（10-30 秒间隔）\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/task/progress {task_id} → 直到 status=success/failed\n```\n\n**步骤 3**：任务完成后，**调详情接口展示价值**\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/detail?id={note_id}\n```\n然后发第二条消息：\n> ✅ 笔记生成完成！\n> - 📄 **原文**：已保存 {web_page.content 字数} 字\n> - 📝 **总结**：{content 内容，即 AI 生成的摘要}\n> - 🔗 **来源**：{web_page.url}\n\n---\n\n## 图片笔记完整流程\n\n**步骤 1**：获取上传凭证\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/image/upload_token?mime_type=jpg&count=1\n```\n\n参数：\n- `mime_type`: `jpg` | `png` | `gif` | `webp`，默认 `png`\n- `count`: 需要的 token 数量，默认 1，最大 9\n\n⚠️ **mime_type 必须与实际文件格式一致**，否则 OSS 签名失败。\n\n返回字段说明见 [api-details.md](api-details.md#图片上传凭证返回字段)。\n\n**步骤 2**：上传文件到 OSS\n\n> ⚠️ **字段顺序必须严格遵守**，否则 OSS 签名验证失败。\n\n字段顺序：`key → OSSAccessKeyId → policy → signature → callback → Content-Type → file`\n\n完整示例见 [api-details.md](api-details.md#oss-上传详细示例)。\n\n**步骤 3**：提交任务\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/save {note_type:\"img_text\", image_urls:[access_url]}\n```\n拿到 task_id 后，**立即发消息给用户**：\n> ✅ 图片已保存，正在识别内容，稍后告诉你结果...\n\n**步骤 4**：后台轮询\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/task/progress {task_id} → 直到 status=success/failed\n```\n\n**步骤 5**：任务完成后，**调详情接口展示价值**\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/detail?id={note_id}\n```\n然后发第二条消息：\n> ✅ 图片笔记生成完成！\n> - 📝 **识别内容**：{content 内容}\n> - 🏷️ **标签**：{tags}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775696593879}}
{"type":"message","id":"f967fa6f","parentId":"ba4588f0","timestamp":"2026-04-09T01:03:22.030Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The image is about \"五福\" from《尚书·洪范》. I need to:1. Get upload token\n2. Upload image to OSS\n3. Save note with the image\n4. Poll for completion\n5. Optionally add to a knowledge base\n\nLet me start with getting the upload token.","thinkingSignature":"1ad14ee45c38e80d86c21d001256ed9830f1841e0ff1427be2af078b3577ddb0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n内容是《尚书·洪范》里的\"五福\"：寿、富、康宁、攸好德、考终命。\n\n开始上传图片到 Get笔记：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_f0eoz2vf2mlr_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\n# 步骤1: 获取上传凭证\ncurl -s \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/image/upload_token?mime_type=jpg&count=1\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" | python3 -m json.tool"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":66335,"output":274,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107125,"cost":{"input":0.019900499999999998,"output":0.00032879999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022660259999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775696593903,"responseId":"06262dd27711a3bc921e11d0df529248"}}
